        "en": "Double Batchim Before a Vowel",
        "ko": "겹받침 뒤에 모음이 오면"
      },
      "text": "Before a vowel, the second consonant moves to the next syllable and the first stays: 닭이 → [달기], 읽어요 → [일거요], 앉아요 → [안자요]. Words like 값이 → [갑씨] and 없어요 → [업써요] also get a tense ㅆ sound."
